  "_about": "Drag cluster, generated by design/gen_drag.py (edit that and regenerate): a full-width shift bar and scale under the hood's curve, the 0-60 mph (0-100 km/h) timer in the middle (runs.js: armed after half a second standing, starts as the car moves, the best time kept), the speed and gear left, the peak boost since the run started and a readout slot right. Clear of the hood and belt light. Full screen: the theme's own clock, range and outside temperature along the bottom, BMW's gear letter left uncovered. No map window. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
